      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Patients with diabetic polyneuropathy were examined to study their biological age, rate of aging and pain syndrome. More rapid rate of aging was revealed in patients with diabetic polyneuropathy and pain syndrome. Using Duloxetin and Gabapentin is reliable to decrease the display of pain syndrome in diabetic polyneuropathy patients. Against the background of pain syndrome therapy the rate of aging is noticed to decrease along with the regression of pain syndrome. The medicines of Duloxetin and Gabapentin which are used during depression and epilepsy protect against aging."},
